From 5dd8b5dabc7bdeb21512f2530699b404cf278d5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: notdefined-inc <notdefined-inc@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 15:19:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] STT provider override + ElevenLabs Realtime token endpoint

- upload.py: /api/transcribe accepts optional 'provider' form field and
  forwards it to transcribe_audio() (backward compatible: 1-arg form used
  when absent)
- routes.py: new POST /api/stt/elevenlabs-token mints a single-use
  realtime_scribe token (env/.env key fallback, per-client 5s limiter with
  burst allowance, auth-gated)
- helpers.py: add 'wasm-unsafe-eval' to script-src so Silero VAD can run
- tests: provider pass-through coverage + token endpoint suite (happy path,
  missing key, upstream failure, empty payload, method guard)
